[
  {
    "text": "故事开始于一次天地异变。",
    "startMs": 350,
    "endMs": 3325,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "有些变化，发生在目光之外。",
    "startMs": 4350,
    "endMs": 7625,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "三万年过去，草木已看不出那一天的痕迹。",
    "startMs": 12350,
    "endMs": 16450,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "欢迎来到维度工序，一座由你设计的跨维工厂。",
    "startMs": 17350,
    "endMs": 21975,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "破损的齿轮之心，增加触及范围、急迫与夜视，但伤害降低百分之十。",
    "startMs": 23350,
    "endMs": 30075,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "开局转速和应力都有限，修复心脏才能逐步放开。",
    "startMs": 31350,
    "endMs": 36750,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "七项额度，约束加工、并发、运输与活跃设备。",
    "startMs": 37850,
    "endMs": 43450,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "七个碎片，顺序修复，逐级解放产能。",
    "startMs": 44350,
    "endMs": 48400,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "完整心脏解除自身限制，并进一步增强个人能力。",
    "startMs": 49350,
    "endMs": 54512,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "用工程设计，让产线成长。",
    "startMs": 55350,
    "endMs": 58888,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "传动轴接入机械工艺，动力与加工进入同一套体系。",
    "startMs": 59850,
    "endMs": 65174,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "发电转为机械容量，风、光和燃料仍然有效。",
    "startMs": 66850,
    "endMs": 72312,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "龙堆也能接轴，启动和护盾仍不可少。",
    "startMs": 73350,
    "endMs": 77675,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "部分机器超速后能并行加工，产能与应力成本一同上涨。",
    "startMs": 78350,
    "endMs": 83800,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "机械工艺的工厂升级，统筹等级、并行与转速。",
    "startMs": 85350,
    "endMs": 90450,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "材料依次加工、注液和装配，制成原版能量板。",
    "startMs": 91350,
    "endMs": 96250,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "数字控制与网络拓扑，帮你定位转速限制。",
    "startMs": 97350,
    "endMs": 102112,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "输入齿轮箱接入ME网络，远端输出齿轮箱驱动机器。",
    "startMs": 102850,
    "endMs": 108425,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "机械输入与AE供电各司其职，还要保证频道正常。",
    "startMs": 110850,
    "endMs": 116150,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "输入一停，输出立即停机。",
    "startMs": 116850,
    "endMs": 119775,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 20
  },
  {
    "text": "这里传递实时应力，不储能。",
    "startMs": 119775,
    "endMs": 122975,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 20
  },
  {
    "text": "五代驱动器，逐级扩容。",
    "startMs": 123850,
    "endMs": 126800,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 21
  },
  {
    "text": "每个网络最多两台生效。",
    "startMs": 126800,
    "endMs": 129712,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 21
  },
  {
    "text": "五代六类，三十张卡。",
    "startMs": 130850,
    "endMs": 133438,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 22
  },
  {
    "text": "按需平衡经济、速度与损耗。",
    "startMs": 133438,
    "endMs": 136888,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 22
  },
  {
    "text": "自动合成避开劣质概率，四张同型卡逐级升级。",
    "startMs": 137850,
    "endMs": 143088,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 23
  },
  {
    "text": "应力不足或总输出转速超额，全网机械输出都会停机。",
    "startMs": 143850,
    "endMs": 149625,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "粗铁绕过研磨、压制和结合，回到起点。",
    "startMs": 150850,
    "endMs": 155138,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "保住样本，再输出余量。",
    "startMs": 155138,
    "endMs": 158088,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 25
  },
  {
    "text": "其他基础矿物，也有各自的循环路线。",
    "startMs": 159850,
    "endMs": 163712,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "铜的回流接上还原、粉碎和提纯，气体也要持续供应。",
    "startMs": 164850,
    "endMs": 170462,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "留足四份面粉恢复下界岩，把概率余量送出，缓冲仓平抑波动。",
    "startMs": 171350,
    "endMs": 177862,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 28
  },
  {
    "text": "面粉加原油制红石，另一支加热再研磨制硫。",
    "startMs": 178850,
    "endMs": 183775,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "燃料，决定工作盆的加热条件。",
    "startMs": 184850,
    "endMs": 188575,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "二十一种熔融材料，沿管道连接合金与回收工艺。",
    "startMs": 189350,
    "endMs": 194400,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 31
  },
  {
    "text": "十二种化学品，接入原有体系。",
    "startMs": 195350,
    "endMs": 198862,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 32
  },
  {
    "text": "同样的木炭，不同热态，产出不同气体。",
    "startMs": 199850,
    "endMs": 204238,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 33
  },
  {
    "text": "进气、出气分开。",
    "startMs": 205350,
    "endMs": 207588,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 34
  },
  {
    "text": "专用盆盖必须关闭，才能止住气体流失。",
    "startMs": 207588,
    "endMs": 211725,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 34
  },
  {
    "text": "露天三十秒，金属流体发生结晶，但仍是液体。",
    "startMs": 212850,
    "endMs": 217600,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 35
  },
  {
    "text": "顶上遮挡，就不生效。",
    "startMs": 217600,
    "endMs": 220288,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 35
  },
  {
    "text": "转速决定压力档位，结晶保留金属来源。",
    "startMs": 221350,
    "endMs": 225675,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 36
  },
