    "text": "化学、结晶与序列装配，连成下界合金工业路线。",
    "startMs": 226850,
    "endMs": 232750,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 37
  },
  {
    "text": "看配方时间，读设备状态，检查产线。",
    "startMs": 233850,
    "endMs": 238150,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 38
  },
  {
    "text": "打包的不只是物品，还有方块、生物与玩家。",
    "startMs": 238850,
    "endMs": 243538,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 39
  },
  {
    "text": "玩家也能坐传送带，经青蛙和锁链，到站再解包。",
    "startMs": 244350,
    "endMs": 249788,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 40
  },
  {
    "text": "第二项修复，解锁个人中转领地。",
    "startMs": 252350,
    "endMs": 255800,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 41
  },
  {
    "text": "用钥匙和快捷键往返。",
    "startMs": 255800,
    "endMs": 258625,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 41
  },
  {
    "text": "包裹进入终端，选择已开放的维度，抵达后解包。",
    "startMs": 259350,
    "endMs": 264212,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 42
  },
  {
    "text": "原生跨维物流，互通三大原版维度。",
    "startMs": 265350,
    "endMs": 269312,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 43
  },
  {
    "text": "潜行蓄力两秒，松开发射，落地还能弹跳。",
    "startMs": 270350,
    "endMs": 275238,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 44
  },
  {
    "text": "竖直带侧面也能运人，潜行即可脱离。",
    "startMs": 278350,
    "endMs": 282538,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 45
  },
  {
    "text": "暮色材料，升级运输。",
    "startMs": 283350,
    "endMs": 286338,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 46
  },
  {
    "text": "一块暮色木头，三个首领奖杯，就能合成升级卡。",
    "startMs": 287350,
    "endMs": 292400,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 47
  },
  {
    "text": "升级终端，旅行页面直达六洞穴。",
    "startMs": 293350,
    "endMs": 297275,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 48
  },
  {
    "text": "暮色材料经过十步装配，升级弹力打包工具。",
    "startMs": 298350,
    "endMs": 303200,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 49
  },
  {
    "text": "农业、烹饪，女仆也来摇曲柄。",
    "startMs": 304350,
    "endMs": 308012,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 50
  },
  {
    "text": "魔法皮蛋，选择五级效果，记住上次选择。",
    "startMs": 308850,
    "endMs": 313550,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 51
  },
  {
    "text": "到期死亡，再吃一颗立即死亡。",
    "startMs": 314350,
    "endMs": 318325,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 52
  },
  {
    "text": "建筑、观察和领地，也有配套调整。",
    "startMs": 319350,
    "endMs": 323662,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 53
  },
  {
    "text": "跨维端点连接三类资源。",
    "startMs": 324350,
    "endMs": 327188,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 54
  },
  {
    "text": "一级已实装，高阶待完善。",
    "startMs": 327188,
    "endMs": 330575,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 54
  },
  {
    "text": "云盘回收库存，物质球接回物流。",
    "startMs": 331350,
    "endMs": 335538,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 55
  },
  {
    "text": "六洞穴可旅行，工业体系继续建设。",
    "startMs": 336350,
    "endMs": 340462,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 56
  },
  {
    "text": "相位、封装与稳定化，让维度长期参与工业。",
    "startMs": 341350,
    "endMs": 346412,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 57
  },
  {
    "text": "工业考核，聚焦真实工程能力，仍在设计。",
    "startMs": 347350,
    "endMs": 351988,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 58
  },
  {
    "text": "这里是维度工序。",
    "startMs": 352850,
    "endMs": 354700,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "shotId": 59
  },
  {
